---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="订阅周刊"
  description="订阅 Agent用例导航周刊（邮件服务待接，暂不提交）。"
  currentPath="/subscribe"
>
  <section class="container subscribe-page">
    <h1>订阅周刊</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      计划每周精选 3–5 条可复现 Agent 玩法。当前为前端占位，
      <strong>邮件服务待接，暂不提交</strong>。
    </p>

    <form class="form-card" onsubmit="return false;" aria-describedby="subscribe-note">
      <label for="email">邮箱</label>
      <input
        id="email"
        name="email"
        type="email"
        placeholder="you@example.com"
        autocomplete="email"
        disabled
      />
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" disabled>订阅（待开通）</button>
      <p class="form-note" id="subscribe-note">
        邮件服务待接，暂不提交。确认 Resend（或等价服务）后再接入真实订阅。
      </p>
    </form>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
